---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy — Shri Kundali">
  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 0">
    <h1 style="color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Your privacy is important to us. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:0.5rem">When you use our service, we collect:</p>
    <ul style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem">
      <li><strong>Birth details:</strong> Date, time, and place of birth (used to generate your kundali report)</li>
      <li><strong>Contact information:</strong> Name and email address</li>
      <li><strong>Payment information:</strong> Processed securely through Razorpay/Cashfree (we do not store card details)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem">
      <li>To generate your personalized kundali report</li>
      <li>To deliver your report via email</li>
      <li>To process payments and refunds</li>
      <li>To provide customer support</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Data Storage & Security</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Your birth data and report are stored securely on our servers. We use industry-standard encryption and security measures. We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Data Retention</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      We retain your data for as long as necessary to provide our services and comply with legal obligations. You may request deletion of your data by contacting us.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      We use the following third-party services:
    </p>
    <ul style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-left:1.5rem">
      <li><strong>Prokerala:</strong> Astrology API for chart calculation</li>
      <li><strong>Razorpay / Cashfree:</strong> Payment processing</li>
      <li><strong>Zoho Mail:</strong> Email delivery</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Your Rights</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@rashikundali.com" style="color:var(--color-primary)">support@rashikundali.com</a> to exercise these rights.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Contact</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      For privacy-related inquiries, email us at <a href="mailto:support@rashikundali.com" style="color:var(--color-primary)">support@rashikundali.com</a>
    </p>

    <p style="color:#888;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid #f0e6d6;padding-top:1rem">
      Last updated: September 2026
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
